<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile D&amp;S started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile D&amp;S started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analyst William McKone has started coverage of Chilean supermarket chain D&amp;S SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;D&amp;S is a well-managed company with sound fundamentals and it has embarked on an aggressive expansion strategy focusing on developing the hypermarket and megamarket business through its Ekono and LIDER formats,&quot; McKone wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- TD&amp;S shares were off five pesos at 415 in Santiago.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
